  "details": "Bios are a important part of vrchat, showing people information you put in about you potentially. While this is good, I feel sometimes in some cases it can reveal too much to people you don't know. \n\nFor example, If I put some more 'personal' information in my bio, anyone, no matter if im offline and not friended to them, can view my bio as long as they have my username. I feel like this could be solved with a privacy toggle to change it between 3 settings.\n\nPublic: Bio is like it is now\n\nSemi-Private: Bio is visible to friends & people in the same world(It will be hidden again if you leave said world if a user doesn't have you friended. Great to keep it to people you are only interacting with)\n\nPrivate: Friends only. This way you only show your bio, which could have personal information, to those you trust(your friends).\n\nOverall I feel this would be a neat little feature, and can help people feel they can put more in their bio without worrying about random strangers looking them up and learning information that otherwise could be used to stalk/in general that person not wanting strangers to know.",
